     "text": "The School Committee minutes of 2 April 2025 list an article to add $500,000 to the FY2026 school budget, and the Finance Committee minutes of 27 January 2026 speak of “the additional $500,000 for schools”. Neither says which lines it went to."
    },
    {
     "figures": {},
     "literals": [],
     "text": "That the difference above is that article is a reading: the amounts match, and nothing here tests it. The line-by-line spread is not in any document held. The line-item budget as voted at Town Meeting, or the district’s own allocation, would settle it."
    }
   ],
