  {
   "block": "explain",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "figures": {},
     "literals": [],
     "text": "Neither document says, and this page does not choose. DESE’s chart of accounts names the codes a district reports to the state; it is silent on how the Town’s ledger or the district’s budget code their own lines. It lists social workers under psychological services, and adjustment counselors under guidance."
    }
   ],
